lt in an allergy to the alpha-gal molecule, which is found in red meat and other products made from mammals.)&nbsp;</p>","updateDate":"2025-06-11T18:24:25Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"Alpha-gal Allergen Inclusion Act","type":"hr","updateDate":"2026-07-31T08:06:14Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-07-31T08:06:14Z"}
